===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂eHs-}}
From {{der|en|xno|-}} and {{der|en|fro|arson}}, from the verb {{m|fro|ardoir}}, from {{der|en|la|ardeō||to burn}}. Compare {{m|en|ardent}}.

